{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2021-12-01 11:28:00', 'title': 'INVESCO ADDS THREE DEFINED MATURITY BOND ETFS TO ITS BULLETSHARES SUITE', 'text': 'ATLANTA, DEC. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0INVESCO LTD. (NYSE: IVZ), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF EXCHANGE-TRADED FUNDS (ETFS), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE THREE NEWEST ADDITIONS TO ITS BULLETSHARES®\xa0ETF SUITE ARE AVAILABLE TO REPLACE THE ETFS MATURING AT YEAR-END 2021.'}